        "text": "This is usually a result of poor 'Freeze-Thaw' or 'Oven Stability' testing. Lab samples are kept in controlled environments, but warehouse temperatures can fluctuate wildly. Every formulation must undergo accelerated aging tests at 45°C for 90 days before launch."
      }
